      text: "Makyan Transformations\n\n[color=#ee4a2d]Level 1 — Makyan Starchild[/color]\n[hr]\nAppearance: Pupils vanish and a smoke-like essence blends into the aura.\nStats: +20% Power, +20% HP, +10% Dexterity\n\nTransformation Abilities:\n[NOVICE] When Makyo Megastar triggers, opponent attack results -2 until their next successful single-die attack; does not stack.\n[INTERMEDIATE] Choose a second Makyo Megastar number; same -2 effect.\n[MASTERED] Two numbers; each triggers within ±1 of the chosen values; same -2 effect.\n\n[color=#ee4a2d]Level 2 — Super Makyan[/color]\n[hr]\nAppearance: A stronger Makyo-powered state.\nStats: +40% Power, +40% HP, +20% Dexterity\n\nTransformation Abilities:\n[NOVICE] Two Makyo numbers, trigger within ±1; opponent -3 attack results until next successful single-die attack.\n[INTERMEDIATE] Trigger window expands to within 2 of chosen numbers; -3.\n[MASTERED] Choose two additional numbers; within-2 trigger; -3.\n\n[color=#ee4a2d]Level 3 — Super Makyan Starchild[/color]\n[hr]\nAppearance: Further amplifies the Starchild connection.\nStats: +60% Power, +60% HP, +30% Dexterity\n\nTransformation Abilities:\n[NOVICE] Choose two more numbers; trigger within 2; opponent -4.\n[INTERMEDIATE] Choose two more numbers; trigger within 3; opponent -4.\n[MASTERED] Choose three more numbers; trigger within 3; opponent -4.\n\n[color=#ee4a2d]Level 4 — Immortal Makyan[/color]\n[hr]\nAppearance: Peak Makyan state tied most strongly to the Makyo Star.\nStats: +70% Power, +90% HP, +40% Dexterity\n\nTransformation Abilities:\n[NOVICE] Choose three more numbers; trigger within 3; opponent -5.\n[INTERMEDIATE] Choose three more; trigger within 4; opponent -5.\n[MASTERED] Choose four more; trigger within 4; opponent -4 (as written in the source).\n",
