      text: "Timelord Transformations\n\n[color=#ee4a2d]Level 1 — Apprentice[/color]\n[hr]\nAppearance: Minor visual distortions from time/dimensional displacement.\nStats: +20% Power, +15% HP, +20% Dexterity\n\nTransformation Abilities:\n[NOVICE] Pool of 6 Timeshifts. Spend 1 after a roll for +1 result, max 3 Timeshifts per roll.\n[INTERMEDIATE] Pool 7; max 3 per roll.\n[MASTERED] Pool 7; max 3; attacks +5% Power damage.\n\n[color=#ee4a2d]Level 2 — Time Master[/color]\n[hr]\nAppearance: Time around the user appears to rewind/fast-forward; aura looks frozen in place.\nStats: +35% Power, +25% HP, +45% Dexterity\n\nTransformation Abilities:\n[NOVICE] Pool 7, max 3/roll. At match start swap one Technique for one Extra Moves technique. Attacks +5% damage.\n[INTERMEDIATE] Pool 8; same swap; +5% damage.\n[MASTERED] Pool 8; swap one Technique for an Extra Move or any move of your Style; +5% damage.\n\n[color=#ee4a2d]Level 3 — Dimension Hopper[/color]\n[hr]\nAppearance: Space seems to bend around the user; dimensional travel may alter the body.\nStats: +55% Power, +45% HP, +60% Dexterity\n\nTransformation Abilities:\n[NOVICE] Pool 9, max 4/roll; swap one Technique for Extra Move/Style move; +5% damage.\n[INTERMEDIATE] Pool 9; swap up to two; +5% damage.\n[MASTERED] Pool 9; swap up to two; +10% damage.\n\n[color=#ee4a2d]Level 4 — Timelord[/color]\n[hr]\nAppearance: Mastery of time/space; body appears as a leaner version of normal form.\nStats: +70% Power, +55% HP, +90% Dexterity\n\nTransformation Abilities:\n[NOVICE] Pool 9, max 5/roll; swap up to two Techniques for Extra Move/Style moves; +10% damage.\n[INTERMEDIATE] Pool 10, max 5; same swap; +10%.\n[MASTERED] Pool 10, max 5; swap up to two for Extra Move, Style, or Freestyle moves; +10% damage.\n",
